    <unit id="=&gt;q2" name="=&gt;q2">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">4</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>All fear the sentinel.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Всі бояться вартового.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q3" name="=&gt;q3">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">6</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Greetings, $(context.player.Name). ::Coughs.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Вітаю, $(context.player.Name). ::Кашляє.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q4" name="=&gt;q4">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">8</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Yes? ::Coughs.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Так? ::Кашляє.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q5" name="=&gt;q5">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">10</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>We are always on the lookout for Ironhead ambushes.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ми завжди насторожі щодо засідок Ironhead.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q6" name="=&gt;q6">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">12</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Foundry's back to delivering the goods. ::Coughs.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ливарня знову почала постачати товари. ::Кашляє.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q7" name="=&gt;q7">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">14</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>The Beast will bother us no more.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Звір більше не турбуватиме нас.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q8" name="=&gt;q8">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">16</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Seen any Faceless approaching?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ви бачили, щоб наближалися якісь Faceless?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q9" name="=&gt;q9">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">18</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>We haven't encountered any Ironheads since Balor's death.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ми не зустрічали Ironhead з часу смерті Балора.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q10" name="=&gt;q10">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">20</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Bloody Ironheads. They can burn in hell. ::Coughs.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Криваві Ironhead. Нехай вони горять у пеклі. ::Кашляє.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q11" name="=&gt;q11">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">22</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>We're heading out to the railway. ::Coughs.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ми вирушаємо на залізницю. ::Кашляє.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q12" name="=&gt;q12">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">24</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>We're ready for the invaders. Thanks for the warning.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ми готові до загарбників. Дякуємо за попередження.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q13" name="=&gt;q13">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">26</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Did you hear the good news? The Faceless lifted the blockade. ::Coughs.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ви чули добрі новини? Faceless зняли блокаду. ::Кашляє.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
